    {
      "source": "The separator used to distinguish between the base name and the locale\n(if any) when <a href=\"#setAsText(java.lang.String)\"><code>converting from a String</code></a>.",
      "translation": "用于在<a href=\"#setAsText(java.lang.String)\"><code>从字符串转换时</code></a>区分基本名称和区域设置（如果有）的分隔符。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "A 'properly configured' Spring <a href=\"../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>container</code></a>\nmight contain a <a href=\"../factory/config/CustomEditorConfigurer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>CustomEditorConfigurer</code></a>\ndefinition such that the conversion can be effected transparently:",
      "translation": "一个“配置正确”的 Spring <a href=\"../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>容器</code></a> 可能包含一个 <a href=\"../factory/config/CustomEditorConfigurer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>CustomEditorConfigurer</code></a> 定义，从而实现透明的类型转换：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Please note that this <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/PropertyEditor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.beans\"><code>PropertyEditor</code></a> is <b>not</b>\nregistered by default with any of the Spring infrastructure.",
      "translation": "请注意，此<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/PropertyEditor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.beans\"><code>PropertyEditor</code></a>默认并未注册到任何 Spring 基础设施中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Only supports conversion <i>from</i> a String, but not <i>to</i> a String.\n\nFind below some examples of using this class in a (properly configured)\nSpring container using XML-based metadata:",
      "translation": "仅支持从 `String` 转换，不支持转换为 `String`。\n\n以下是使用此类在基于 XML 的元数据配置的（正确配置的）Spring 容器中使用的一些示例：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Thanks to David Leal Valmana for the suggestion and initial prototype.",
      "translation": "感谢 David Leal Valmana 提出建议并制作初始原型。",
